        <p>Elements per node: 4B 2560×1024, 8B 4096×1024, 27B 5120×6144; nrows=2 in
        all three, so per-activation numbers are these values halved.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">
  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">appendix</p>
    <details>
      <summary>Run environment and verification</summary>
